#: data/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.desktop.in
#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "An all-in-one Muslim app for Linux"
msgstr "Aplikasi serba guna untuk umat Muslim di Linux"

#: data/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.desktop.in
msgid "Prayer;Islam;Salah;"
msgstr "Doa;Islam;Shalat;"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Khushu is your all-in-one Muslim app for Linux desktop, tablets, and "
"smartphones. It centralizes your daily worship by providing accurate prayer "
"times, native staggered Adkar notifications, and a dedicated Noble Quran "
"reader—all with uncompromising privacy and zero telemetry."
msgstr ""
"Khushu adalah aplikasi serba guna untuk umat Muslim yang dirancang khusus "
"untuk desktop Linux, tablet, dan ponsel. Aplikasi ini memudahkan ibadah "
"harian Anda dengan menyediakan waktu shalat yang akurat, notifikasi Al-"
"Ma'surat yang terintegrasi secara otomatis, serta pembaca Al-Quran yang "
"khusus—semuanya dengan privasi yang terjamin dan tanpa pengumpulan data."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Accurate prayer calculation methods (Offline)"
msgstr "Metode perhitungan shalat yang akurat (Offline)"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Morning, Evening, and Night Adkar with built-in counters"
msgstr "Al-Ma'surat Pagi, Sore, dan Malam dengan penghitung bawaan"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Customizable Adhan system notifications (Makkah/Madinah audio)"
msgstr ""
"Pemberitahuan sistem adzan yang dapat disesuaikan (audio Makkah/Madinah)"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Dedicated Noble Quran reader with adjustable Arabic and translation "
"typography"
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi pembaca Al-Quran yang dilengkapi dengan pilihan tipografi teks Arab "
"dan terjemahan yang dapat disesuaikan"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Interactive Qibla compass"
msgstr "Kompas arah Kiblat interaktif"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Hijri calendar mapping"
msgstr "Pemetaan kalender Hijriah"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Privacy-first local encryption for your location data"
msgstr "Enkripsi lokal yang mengutamakan privasi untuk data lokasi Anda"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Modern Libadwaita interface with adaptive Dark Mode"
msgstr "Antarmuka Libadwaita modern dengan Mode Gelap yang adaptif"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Multi-language support"
msgstr "Dukungan multibahasa"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Welcome & Onboarding: Easy first-time setup for location, language, and "
"calculation method"
msgstr ""
"Selamat Datang & Panduan Awal: Pengaturan awal yang mudah untuk lokasi, "
"bahasa, dan metode perhitungan"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Prayer Times Dashboard: View accurate daily Salah times, upcoming prayer "
"countdown, and Hijri date"
msgstr ""
"Dasbor Waktu Shalat: Lihat jadwal shalat harian yang akurat, hitung mundur "
"waktu shalat berikutnya, dan tanggal Hijriah"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Hijri Calendar: Browse the full Islamic calendar with accurate Hijri date "
"mapping"
msgstr ""
"Kalender Hijriah: Lihat kalender Islam lengkap dengan pemetaan tanggal "
"Hijriah yang akurat"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Interactive Qibla compass pointing to Mecca via GPS or E-Compass sensor"
msgstr ""
"Kompas Kiblat interaktif yang menunjuk ke arah Mekah melalui GPS atau sensor "
"E-Compass"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Noble Quran: Read Arabic ayat and translations with adjustable typography"
msgstr ""
"Al-Quran yang Mulia: Baca ayat-ayat dalam bahasa Arab beserta terjemahannya "
"dengan tata letak teks yang dapat disesuaikan"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"App Settings: Configure your location, language, appearance, and prayer "
"settings"
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan Aplikasi: Atur lokasi, bahasa, tampilan, dan pengaturan doa Anda"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Adkar & Supplications: Access Daily Adkar with built-in counters and "
"staggered notifications"
msgstr ""
"Al - Ma'surat dan Permohonan: Akses Al-Ma'surat harian dengan penghitung "
"bawaan dan notifikasi bertahap"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Djalel Oukid"
msgstr "Djalel Oukid"

