#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Added a fully offline Noble Qur'an module featuring the Qur'anic text in "
"Uthmanic orthography (rasm), translations, mushaf-style navigation, "
"diacritic-aware search, saved reading positions, and adjustable typography."
msgstr ""
"Ditambahkan modul Al-Qur'an Karim yang sepenuhnya dapat digunakan secara "
"offline, yang menampilkan teks Al-Qur'an dalam ejaan Utsmaniyah (rasm), "
"terjemahan, navigasi bergaya mushaf, fitur pencarian yang mendukung tanda "
"baca, penyimpanan posisi bacaan, serta tipografi yang dapat disesuaikan."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Added Mawaqit API integration as an alternative prayer times source."
msgstr ""
"Ditambahkan integrasi API Mawaqit sebagai sumber waktu shalat alternatif."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Added ICU-backed localization for location and timezone labels, plus "
"validated custom IANA timezone editing."
msgstr ""
"Ditambahkan lokalisasi yang didukung ICU untuk label lokasi dan zona waktu, "
"serta pengeditan zona waktu IANA khusus yang telah diverifikasi."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Reorganized settings into clearer General, Prayer Setup, and Alerts sections "
"with improved inline editing behavior."
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan telah diorganisir ulang menjadi bagian-bagian yang lebih jelas, "
"yaitu Umum, Pengaturan Shalat, dan Pemberitahuan, dengan peningkatan pada "
"fitur pengeditan langsung."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Fixed Snap tray icon visibility via an upstream patch to ksni (resolves "
"AppArmor D-Bus blocking)."
msgstr ""
"Perbaikan masalah visibilitas ikon baki Snap melalui tambalan hulu pada ksni "
"(mengatasi masalah pemblokiran D-Bus oleh AppArmor)."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed Snap autostart and notification icon rendering."
msgstr ""
"Masalah terkait pengaktifan otomatis Snap dan tampilan ikon notifikasi telah "
"diperbaiki."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Improved locale detection and fallback logic."
msgstr "Peningkatan dalam deteksi wilayah dan logika cadangan."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed Flatpak autostart failure and missing --background flag."
msgstr ""
"Perbaikan masalah kegagalan autostart Flatpak dan hilangnya opsi --"
"background."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Fixed over-translation of proper nouns (e.g., Muslim) in non-English locales."
msgstr ""
"Masalah terjemahan berlebihan pada nama-nama khusus (misalnya, Muslim) di "
"wilayah non-Inggris telah diperbaiki."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Added new localized AppStream screenshots for improved store presence."
msgstr ""
"Telah ditambahkan tangkapan layar AppStream yang telah dilokalkan untuk "
"meningkatkan daya tarik di toko aplikasi."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed tray icon translation extraction (Quit and Open Khushu entries)."
msgstr ""
"Perbaikan pengambilan terjemahan ikon baki (entri Keluar dan Buka Khushu)."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed AppStream metadata translation (descriptions and keywords)."
msgstr "Fixed AppStream metadata translation (descriptions and keywords)."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Improved tray behavior to update labels immediately on language change."
msgstr ""
"Improved tray behavior to update labels immediately on language change."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Initial stable release of Khushu."
msgstr "Initial stable release of Khushu."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Added Indonesian (id) translation by WiqbalRar."
msgstr "Terjemahan bahasa Indonesia (id) oleh WiqbalRar telah ditambahkan."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed custom audio save crash on non-main thread."
msgstr ""
"Crash saat menyimpan audio kustom di luar thread utama berhasil diperbaiki."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed language not persisting after app restart."
msgstr ""
"Masalah bahasa yang tidak tersimpan setelah aplikasi dimulai ulang telah "
"diperbaiki."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed data loss on exit with synchronous atomic config save."
msgstr "Fixed data loss on exit with synchronous atomic config save."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed autostart portal command double-wrapping."
msgstr ""
"Masalah pembungkus ganda pada perintah autostart portal telah diperbaiki."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed notification toggles reverting on restart due to UI override."
msgstr ""
"Masalah tombol pengaturan notifikasi yang kembali ke pengaturan awal saat "
"perangkat dihidupkan ulang akibat penggantian antarmuka pengguna telah "
"diperbaiki."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Fixed audio selection reverting on restart due to file check on bundled "
"presets."
msgstr ""
"Fixed audio selection reverting on restart due to file check on bundled "
"presets."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Improved audio playback engine with streaming decode."
msgstr "Improved audio playback engine with streaming decode."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Improved Qibla compass performance with Pango and bearing caching."
msgstr ""
"Peningkatan kinerja kompas kiblat berkat Pango dan penyimpanan data arah."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Improved timer controller with daily state caching."
msgstr ""
"Pengendali timer yang disempurnakan dengan penyimpanan sementara status "
"harian."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Improved config persistence with singleton save channel."
msgstr "Improved config persistence with singleton save channel."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed application crashes caused by notification re-entrancy."
msgstr "Fixed application crashes caused by notification re-entrancy."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed configuration data race when saving from multiple threads."
msgstr "Fixed configuration data race when saving from multiple threads."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed thread safety issues in locale setup and audio initialization."
msgstr "Fixed thread safety issues in locale setup and audio initialization."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Replaced 26 unsafe unwrap() calls with proper error messages."
msgstr ""
"Mengganti 26 panggilan fungsi `unwrap()` yang tidak aman dengan pesan "
"kesalahan yang tepat."

